in, you\u2019ll face Hoerni and his friends in clever solitaire-style card battles.\n\nThis time, a brand-new core mechanic is introduced. Instead of just 4 dungeon cards, you now play with up to 16 cards stacked across 4 columns. Sort, equip, and sell cards to outwit every monster in the deck. Harness plenty of new spell cards and, for the first time, add equipment items to your runs, which add a whole new layer of strategy.\n\nGrow your collection and take on a variety of offline and online game modes that will test your skills with each of the newly added hero types.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/card-crawl-2", "videos": [{"id": 186610, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "tUnDacv7jns", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tUnDacv7jns", "title": "Card Crawl 2 Release Date Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tUnDacv7jns/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186611, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "nMcBJjnVByg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMcBJjnVByg", "title": "Card Crawl2 Standard Mode gameplay with Kings Guard", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nMcBJjnVByg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186612, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "K63zTWFeWaY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K63zTWFeWaY", "title": "Card Crawl 2 Classic mode gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K63zTWFeWaY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186613, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "767RqnXdL88", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=767RqnXdL88", "title": "Card Crawl 2 Developer Showcase", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/767RqnXdL88/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}